    },
    {
      "start": 31.88,
      "end": 34.56,
      "text": "體驗文化和生活的多餘演者。"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.56,
      "end": 37.8,
      "text": "那剛剛你們聽到的是我和最近新出的電影。"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.8,
      "end": 39.16,
      "text": "奧德賽的主演"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.16,
      "end": 41.28,
      "text": "馬特達蒙的對話"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.28,
      "end": 43.68,
      "text": "我這兩天剛剛從北京回到上海。"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.68,
      "end": 46.16,
      "text": "是因為我去那邊參加了奧德賽。"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.16,
      "end": 48.44,
      "text": "在北京舉辦的首映裡。"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.44,
      "end": 51.44,
      "text": "那天我們在全國最好的IMACS。"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.44,
      "end": 53.6,
      "text": "畫幅上面看了這部電影。"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.6,
      "end": 56.64,
      "text": "並且當天導演Christopher Nolan。"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.64,
      "end": 58.72,
      "text": "他們的製片人Emma Thomas。"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.72,
      "end": 60.52,
      "text": "以及兩位主演 Matt Damon。"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.52,
      "end": 63.04,
      "text": "和Charliss Theron都有到達現場。"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.04,
      "end": 66.28,
      "text": "還舉辦了一場非常精彩的講座。"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.28,
      "end": 68.76,
      "text": "並且第二天還受到環球的邀請。"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.76,
      "end": 70.4,
      "text": "和馬特達蒙坐下來。"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.4,
      "end": 72.12,
      "text": "面對面的聊了聊"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.12,
      "end": 74.36,
      "text": "我看完電影的感受。"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.36,
      "end": 77.04,
      "text": "那如果有在小紅書上關注我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.04,
      "end": 78.64,
      "text": "應該有看到"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.64,
      "end": 80.92,
      "text": "我從去年開始"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.92,
      "end": 84.16,
      "text": "有開始經常採訪不同的電影主演。"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.16,
      "end": 85.56,
      "text": "那這一次"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.56,
      "end": 87.64,
      "text": "我的感覺非常的不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.68,
      "end": 90.24,
      "text": "因為與其說是一個採訪。"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.24,
      "end": 94.36,
      "text": "我更覺得他是一個成長福的。"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.36,
      "end": 96.28,
      "text": "因為馬特達蒙真的是一個。"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.28,
      "end": 98.36,
      "text": "非常溫柔的人"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.36,
      "end": 100.56,
      "text": "他看人的眼神非常的真誠。"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.56,
      "end": 103.04,
      "text": "回答也總是能夠用幾句話。"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.04,
      "end": 106.24,
      "text": "非常精準的說到重點上。"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.24,
      "end": 109.6,
      "text": "並且這是我第一次被我的採訪者反問。"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.6,
      "end": 111.52,
      "text": "問我對我自己提出的問題。"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.52,
      "end": 113.24,
      "text": "是什麼樣的看法"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 114.64,
      "text": "所以採訪出來之後。"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.64,
      "end": 118.08,
      "text": "我整個人都覺得非常的輕鬆和充盈。"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.72,
      "end": 122.08,
      "text": "那麼在跟大家分享採訪片段之前。"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.08,
      "end": 123.64,
      "text": "我想先簡單介紹一下。"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.64,
      "end": 125.44,
      "text": "奧德塞的故事背景。"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.08,
      "end": 129.08,
      "text": "奧德塞奧德塞這個故事。"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.08,
      "end": 132.64,
      "text": "是西方文學史上最重要的史詩之一。"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.64,
      "end": 134.92,
      "text": "它是由古希臘式人和馬創作的。"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.92,
      "end": 136.36,
      "text": "一個神話故事"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.36,
      "end": 139.04,
      "text": "它的地位大家可以理解為是。"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.04,
      "end": 140.68,
      "text": "歐洲版的汽油劑"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.68,
      "end": 142.52,
      "text": "或者是風神堡"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.52,
      "end": 146.32,
      "text": "這個故事的主角叫做奧德塞奧德塞奧。"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.32,
      "end": 148.24,
      "text": "他是伊薩卡的國王。"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.24,
      "end": 151.96,
      "text": "同時也是西臘聯軍中最聰慧的將領之一。"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.96,
      "end": 155.88,
      "text": "他一直以足之多謀而著名的。"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.88,
      "end": 158.04,
      "text": "翻譯過來就是我們的朱葛亮。"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.04,
      "end": 160.64,
      "text": "當他們在打一場非常難的仗的時候。"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.64,
      "end": 163.0,
      "text": "他想出來了一個非常聰明的技巧。"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.0,
      "end": 164.92,
      "text": "叫做木馬技"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.92,
      "end": 166.24,
      "text": "通過他的木馬技"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.24,
      "end": 168.76,
      "text": "他們成功的攻陷了特洛伊城。"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.76,
      "end": 171.64,
      "text": "打了一場非常漂亮的勝仗。"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.68,
      "end": 172.64,
      "text": "打完這個仗"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.64,
      "end": 175.8,
      "text": "他們就當然說說準備回家了。"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.8,
      "end": 177.6,
      "text": "卻萬萬沒想到"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.6,
      "end": 181.36,
      "text": "他在回家的路上遇到了各種各樣的困難。"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.36,
      "end": 182.6,
      "text": "有被詛咒"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.6,
      "end": 183.92,
      "text": "有遇到了怪獸"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.92,
      "end": 185.4,
      "text": "有遇到海妖"
    },
    {
      "start": 185.4,
      "end": 188.72,
      "text": "還有各種各樣的天災人禍。"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.72,
      "end": 190.04,
      "text": "所以回家的這一路。"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.04,
      "end": 192.56,
      "text": "他走了整整20年。"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.56,
      "end": 194.84,
      "text": "奧德塞這個故事以及這部電影。"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.84,
      "end": 197.96,
      "text": "講的就是他打完聖上之後。"
    },
    {
      "start": 197.96,
      "end": 200.16,
      "text": "回家路上的種種經歷。"
    },
    {
      "start": 200.16,
      "end": 203.72,
      "text": "多的我當然就不跟大家繼續劇透了。"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.72,
      "end": 206.88,
      "text": "大家如果沒有看過這個故事的話。"
    },
    {
      "start": 206.88,
      "end": 211.52,
      "text": "我想想一定會被這部電影非常精彩的視覺。"
    },
    {
      "start": 211.52,
      "end": 215.0,
      "text": "以及這種接二連三的讓人意想不到的。"
    },
    {
      "start": 215.0,
      "end": 217.32,
      "text": "困難賢族所驚喜到。"
    },
    {
      "start": 217.32,
      "end": 219.88,
      "text": "那麼接下來我就想跟大家分享。"
    },
    {
      "start": 219.88,
      "end": 222.24,
      "text": "我和馬特達蒙的對話。"
    },
    {
      "start": 222.24,
      "end": 225.52,
      "text": "我們幾乎是完全沒有刪減的。"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.52,
      "end": 229.72,
      "text": "跟大家分享了我們的所聊的所有的話題。"
    },
    {
      "start": 229.72,
      "end": 231.96,
      "text": "那麼接下來就享受。"
    },
    {
      "start": 349.76,
      "end": 352.44,
      "text": "因為我們全都在做這部電影。"
    },
    {
      "start": 352.44,
      "end": 355.28,
      "text": "而且我們覺得這個機會。"
    },
    {
      "start": 355.28,
      "end": 357.16,
      "text": "我們是第一次 ever try to do。"
    },
    {
      "start": 357.16,
      "end": 359.04,
      "text": "一部電影就像這部電影。"
    },
    {
      "start": 359.04,
      "end": 359.56,
      "text": "你知道嗎"
    },
    {
      "start": 359.56,
      "end": 362.92,
      "text": "然後我們感覺到我們是搜尋者。"
    },
    {
      "start": 362.92,
      "end": 364.2,
      "text": "我們是第一次去"
    },
    {
      "start": 364.2,
      "end": 367.64,
      "text": "所以我們有很多的心情。"
    },
    {
      "start": 367.64,
      "end": 370.48,
      "text": "還有很多的尊敬"
    },
    {
      "start": 370.48,
      "end": 372.2,
      "text": "為了大家的努力"
    },
    {
      "start": 372.2,
      "end": 376.04,
      "text": "我認為這部電影是一種。"
    },
    {
      "start": 376.04,
      "end": 377.68,
      "text": "很 Romantic experience for sure。"
    },
    {
      "start": 377.68,
      "end": 379.08,
      "text": "還有很多的信心"
    },
    {
      "start": 379.08,
      "end": 380.08,
      "text": "對"
    },
    {
      "start": 380.08,
      "end": 383.52,
      "text": "因為我看到的 backstage of the making of the movie。"
    },
    {
      "start": 383.52,
      "end": 385.96,
      "text": "the huge machines。"
    },
    {
      "start": 385.96,
      "end": 389.52,
      "text": "all those armors that you brought to Iceland。"
    },
    {
      "start": 389.52,
      "end": 391.2,
      "text": "to such a place。"
    },
    {
      "start": 391.2,
      "end": 393.36,
      "text": "Can I ask which month was it?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 393.36,
      "end": 395.4,
      "text": "That was in June。"
    },
    {
      "start": 395.4,
      "end": 396.32,
      "text": "June's, okay。"
    },
    {
      "start": 396.32,
      "end": 397.6,
      "text": "It was there summertime。"
    },
    {
      "start": 397.6,
      "end": 399.92,
      "text": "but it did not feel like it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 399.92,
      "end": 400.64,
      "text": "I can imagine。"
    },
    {
      "start": 400.64,
      "end": 403.52,
      "text": "because Iceland is hard enough just to be there。"
    },
    {
      "start": 403.52,
      "end": 404.96,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 404.96,
      "end": 406.64,
      "text": "It's a beautiful country。"
    },
    {
      "start": 407.48,
      "end": 409.6,
      "text": "I shot there with Chris on Interstellar。"
    },
    {
      "start": 409.6,
      "end": 411.92,
      "text": "we shot on the glacier。"
    },
    {
      "start": 411.92,
      "end": 414.48,
      "text": "and it's an incredible place to work。"
    },
    {
      "start": 414.48,
      "end": 416.32,
      "text": "and really good crews there。"
    },
    {
      "start": 416.32,
      "end": 418.76,
      "text": "and good people。"
    },
    {
      "start": 418.76,
      "end": 420.24,
      "text": "but very challenging。"
    },
    {
      "start": 420.24,
      "end": 422.96,
      "text": "And there was a moment where you were on the boat。"
    },
    {
      "start": 422.96,
      "end": 426.52,
      "text": "and a dolphin just jumped out from the sea。"
    },
    {
      "start": 426.52,
      "end": 428.48,
      "text": "and I feel like that's the magic。"
    },
    {
      "start": 428.48,
      "end": 430.24,
      "text": "Yeah, that's the magic of being out there。"
    },
    {
      "start": 430.24,
      "end": 432.68,
      "text": "things happen。"
    },
    {
      "start": 432.68,
      "end": 435.68,
      "text": "and you just are in the real world。"
    },
    {
      "start": 436.68,
      "end": 439.24,
      "text": "And I feel like you can always see that in a movie。"
    },
    {
      "start": 439.24,
      "end": 442.8,
      "text": "You can see it in the faces of everybody who's out there。"
    },
    {
      "start": 442.8,
      "end": 446.4,
      "text": "You know, that it's really the wind and salt water。"
    },
    {
      "start": 446.4,
      "end": 447.72,
      "text": "and all of that。"
    },
    {
      "start": 447.72,
      "end": 448.68,
      "text": "You're in the elements。"
    },
    {
      "start": 448.68,
      "end": 451.52,
      "text": "and that's what this movie needs, right?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 451.52,
      "end": 453.2,
      "text": "You need to take the audience。"
    },
    {
      "start": 453.2,
      "end": 455.76,
      "text": "and put them on the journey with the characters。"
    },
    {
      "start": 455.76,
      "end": 460.12,
      "text": "and that's what that IMAX format does so beautifully。"
    },
    {
      "start": 460.12,
      "end": 462.0,
      "text": "And you were in there too。"
    },
    {
      "start": 462.0,
      "end": 465.48,
      "text": "because you were exactly experiencing。"
    },
    {
      "start": 465.64,
      "end": 467.4,
      "text": "but the characters are experiencing。"
    },
    {
      "start": 467.4,
      "end": 469.84,
      "text": "Yeah, it makes it a lot easier to do my job。"
    },
    {
      "start": 469.84,
      "end": 471.64,
      "text": "Yes, I did when I was watching。"
    },
    {
      "start": 471.64,
      "end": 473.16,
      "text": "I was just thinking。"
    },
    {
      "start": 473.16,
      "end": 476.4,
      "text": "Man, just let this poor man go home。"
    },
    {
      "start": 476.4,
      "end": 477.8,
      "text": "All he wants to do is go home。"
    },
    {
      "start": 477.8,
      "end": 479.56,
      "text": "but there were so many challenges。"
    },
    {
      "start": 479.56,
      "end": 480.92,
      "text": "one after another。"
    },
    {
      "start": 480.92,
      "end": 483.32,
      "text": "and usually most stories tell us。"
    },
    {
      "start": 483.32,
      "end": 485.36,
      "text": "how difficult it is to win。"
    },
    {
      "start": 485.36,
      "end": 489.6,
      "text": "but Odyssey concentrates on what happens after the victory。"
    },
    {
      "start": 489.6,
      "end": 494.28,
      "text": "So I wonder why in this story。"
    },
    {
      "start": 494.28,
      "end": 497.12,
      "text": "Going home is harder than winning。"
    },
    {
      "start": 497.12,
      "end": 499.4,
      "text": "That's a great question。"
    },
    {
      "start": 499.4,
      "end": 503.32,
      "text": "And that's been the question since it was written。"
    },
    {
      "start": 503.32,
      "end": 505.8,
      "text": "What is the aftermath of the victory。"
    },
    {
      "start": 505.8,
      "end": 507.32,
      "text": "and what does it mean。"
    },
    {
      "start": 507.32,
      "end": 509.88,
      "text": "and what do you carry。"
    },
    {
      "start": 509.88,
      "end": 512.32,
      "text": "and to what degree are you accountable。"
    },
    {
      "start": 512.32,
      "end": 515.08,
      "text": "for the decisions you make。"
    },
    {
      "start": 515.08,
      "end": 517.92,
      "text": "What does that mean for your life?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 517.92,
      "end": 519.68,
      "text": "And what it takes to win。"
    },
    {
      "start": 519.68,
      "end": 521.16,
      "text": "What comes after。"
    },
    {
      "start": 521.24,
      "end": 523.76,
      "text": "If you don't take accountability。"
    },
    {
      "start": 523.76,
      "end": 526.44,
      "text": "for what you did just for winning。"
    },
    {
      "start": 526.44,
      "end": 527.4,
      "text": "That's right。"
    },
    {
      "start": 527.4,
      "end": 528.76,
      "text": "It's not just about a hero。"
    },
    {
      "start": 528.76,
      "end": 531.04,
      "text": "It's about everyone。"
    },
    {
      "start": 531.04,
      "end": 532.2,
      "text": "What are the sacrifices。"
    },
    {
      "start": 532.2,
      "end": 533.84,
      "text": "that you're willing to take。"
    },
    {
      "start": 533.84,
      "end": 535.32,
      "text": "That's exactly right。"
    },
    {
      "start": 535.32,
      "end": 536.96,
      "text": "Yeah, and in fact。"
    },
    {
      "start": 536.96,
      "end": 537.84,
      "text": "when I first read it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 537.84,
      "end": 539.12,
      "text": "I said to Chris that。"
    },
    {
      "start": 539.12,
      "end": 542.4,
      "text": "it reminded me in many ways of Oppenheimer。"
    },
    {
      "start": 542.4,
      "end": 545.96,
      "text": "and it has some similar themes。"
    },
    {
      "start": 545.96,
      "end": 547.24,
      "text": "and of course this。"
    },
    {
      "start": 547.24,
      "end": 550.2,
      "text": "the Odyssey is so rich thematically。"
    },
    {
      "start": 550.28,
      "end": 552.8,
      "text": "It almost depends on where you are in your life。"
    },
    {
      "start": 552.8,
      "end": 554.04,
      "text": "when you encounter the story。"
    },
    {
      "start": 554.04,
      "end": 556.32,
      "text": "because it can be about homecoming。"
    },
    {
      "start": 556.32,
      "end": 557.48,
      "text": "or family or love。"
    },
    {
      "start": 557.48,
      "end": 559.88,
      "text": "or war or death or regret。"
    },
    {
      "start": 559.88,
      "end": 563.56,
      "text": "There's so much in the story。"
    },
    {
      "start": 563.56,
      "end": 565.0,
      "text": "that depending on。"
    },
    {
      "start": 565.0,
      "end": 566.48,
      "text": "what you're going through in your life。"
    },
    {
      "start": 566.48,
      "end": 568.56,
      "text": "or how old you are even。"
    },
    {
      "start": 568.56,
      "end": 569.96,
      "text": "what your experience has been。"
    },
    {
      "start": 569.96,
      "end": 572.0,
      "text": "it speaks to you in different ways。"
    },
    {
      "start": 572.0,
      "end": 574.56,
      "text": "So what is your biggest take away from the story?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 574.56,
      "end": 576.84,
      "text": "I loved the adaptation that Chris did。"
    },
    {
      "start": 576.84,
      "end": 580.16,
      "text": "and I was the right。"
    },
    {
      "start": 580.56,
      "end": 582.28,
      "text": "at the right point in my life。"
    },
    {
      "start": 582.28,
      "end": 583.72,
      "text": "to take this role on。"
    },
    {
      "start": 583.72,
      "end": 585.08,
      "text": "it's an amazing role。"
    },
    {
      "start": 585.08,
      "end": 587.84,
      "text": "and you know。"
    },
    {
      "start": 587.84,
      "end": 589.8,
      "text": "I probably would have thought。"
    },
    {
      "start": 589.8,
      "end": 591.12,
      "text": "I could have done it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 591.12,
      "end": 592.48,
      "text": "when I was 35。"
    },
    {
      "start": 592.48,
      "end": 595.36,
      "text": "but I think it's better to do it at 55。"
    },
    {
      "start": 595.36,
      "end": 596.52,
      "text": "when you understand more。"
    },
    {
      "start": 596.52,
      "end": 597.84,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 597.84,
      "end": 599.56,
      "text": "and also I kind of feel like。"
    },
    {
      "start": 599.56,
      "end": 603.32,
      "text": "35 is the stage where you try to win。"
    },
    {
      "start": 603.32,
      "end": 605.0,
      "text": "and 55 is the stage。"
    },
    {
      "start": 605.0,
      "end": 607.96,
      "text": "when you are starting to come home。"
    },
    {
      "start": 607.96,
      "end": 608.76,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah。"
    },
    {
      "start": 609.12,
      "end": 611.2,
      "text": "I think that's right。"
    },
    {
      "start": 611.2,
      "end": 612.6,
      "text": "I've definitely felt that shift。"
    },
    {
      "start": 612.6,
      "end": 613.96,
      "text": "coming into my fifties。"
    },
    {
      "start": 613.96,
      "end": 616.4,
      "text": "you get a new perspective。"
    },
    {
      "start": 616.4,
      "end": 618.36,
      "text": "a lot of life is behind you。"
    },
    {
      "start": 618.36,
      "end": 620.44,
      "text": "and you have a good chance。"
    },
    {
      "start": 620.44,
      "end": 621.36,
      "text": "to reflect on that。"
    },
    {
      "start": 621.36,
      "end": 623.12,
      "text": "and really think about。"
    },
    {
      "start": 623.12,
      "end": 625.4,
      "text": "where you're going。"
    },
    {
      "start": 625.4,
      "end": 626.84,
      "text": "where do you think you're trying。"
    },
    {
      "start": 626.84,
      "end": 628.48,
      "text": "to go right now?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 628.48,
      "end": 630.08,
      "text": "is it easier than odyssey?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 630.08,
      "end": 632.2,
      "text": "definitely easier than odyssey。"
    },
    {
      "start": 632.2,
      "end": 633.64,
      "text": "I think"
    },
    {
      "start": 633.64,
      "end": 635.04,
      "text": "you know I'm very lucky。"
    },
    {
      "start": 635.04,
      "end": 637.48,
      "text": "with the family that I have。"
    },
    {
      "start": 637.48,
      "end": 638.72,
      "text": "and the family that we've built。"
    },
    {
      "start": 639.48,
      "end": 640.84,
      "text": "I have a very clear sense。"
    },
    {
      "start": 640.84,
      "end": 642.64,
      "text": "of where home is for me。"
    },
    {
      "start": 642.64,
      "end": 644.56,
      "text": "Oh, that's so beautiful。"
    },
    {
      "start": 644.56,
      "end": 645.2,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 645.2,
      "end": 647.72,
      "text": "So I really love。"
    },
    {
      "start": 647.72,
      "end": 649.52,
      "text": "love the line。"
    },
    {
      "start": 649.52,
      "end": 650.8,
      "text": "at the end of the movie。"
    },
    {
      "start": 650.8,
      "end": 652.0,
      "text": "which I actually saw before。"
    },
    {
      "start": 652.0,
      "end": 653.36,
      "text": "I watch it is。"
    },
    {
      "start": 653.36,
      "end": 655.36,
      "text": "what you most wanted。"
    },
    {
      "start": 655.36,
      "end": 657.32,
      "text": "is what you most can have。"
    },
    {
      "start": 657.32,
      "end": 658.76,
      "text": "and what you most can have。"
    },
    {
      "start": 658.76,
      "end": 661.88,
      "text": "is what you had but lost。"
    },
    {
      "start": 661.88,
      "end": 663.16,
      "text": "kind of scares me。"
    },
    {
      "start": 663.16,
      "end": 664.4,
      "text": "as a 30-year-old。"
    },
    {
      "start": 664.4,
      "end": 666.64,
      "text": "because I have to be careful。"
    },
    {
      "start": 666.64,
      "end": 668.12,
      "text": "about what I want。"
    },
    {
      "start": 668.12,
      "end": 668.56,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 668.56,
      "end": 670.88,
      "text": "What's your intake about this?。"
    },
    {
      "start": 670.88,
      "end": 672.68,
      "text": "Well, I'm much more interested。"
    },
    {
      "start": 672.68,
      "end": 673.32,
      "text": "to hear yours。"
    },
    {
      "start": 673.32,
      "end": 674.68,
      "text": "That's why I love this。"
    },
    {
      "start": 674.68,
      "end": 676.0,
      "text": "this part of the process。"
    },
    {
      "start": 676.0,
      "end": 677.2,
      "text": "where we get to put the movie。"
    },
    {
      "start": 677.2,
      "end": 678.36,
      "text": "in front of。"
    },
    {
      "start": 678.36,
      "end": 679.2,
      "text": "in front of people。"
    },
    {
      "start": 679.2,
      "end": 680.76,
      "text": "and hear how that resonates。"
    },
    {
      "start": 680.76,
      "end": 681.12,
      "text": "Right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 681.12,
      "end": 682.44,
      "text": "Because I think it's a very。"
    },
    {
      "start": 682.44,
      "end": 684.16,
      "text": "personal question。"
    },
    {
      "start": 684.16,
      "end": 684.48,
      "text": "Right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 684.48,
      "end": 685.28,
      "text": "So it'll resonate。"
    },
    {
      "start": 685.28,
      "end": 686.48,
      "text": "with everybody differently。"
    },
    {
      "start": 686.48,
      "end": 688.2,
      "text": "but it's a very profound one。"
    },
    {
      "start": 688.2,
      "end": 689.68,
      "text": "it's a very profound idea。"
    },
    {
      "start": 689.68,
      "end": 690.72,
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "start": 690.72,
      "end": 692.0,
      "text": "and it's something。"
    },
    {
      "start": 692.0,
      "end": 693.08,
      "text": "you hear a lot of people。"
    },
    {
      "start": 693.08,
      "end": 694.08,
      "text": "later in their life。"
    },
    {
      "start": 694.08,
      "end": 696.32,
      "text": "as they're reflecting back。"
    },
    {
      "start": 696.32,
      "end": 697.84,
      "text": "and thinking about。"
    },
    {
      "start": 697.84,
      "end": 699.24,
      "text": "what they prioritized。"
    },
    {
      "start": 699.24,
      "end": 700.08,
      "text": "and what they didn't。"
    },
    {
      "start": 700.08,
      "end": 701.76,
      "text": "and regret。"
    },
    {
      "start": 701.76,
      "end": 703.0,
      "text": "can accompany that feeling。"
    },
    {
      "start": 703.0,
      "end": 703.4,
      "text": "for sure。"
    },
    {
      "start": 703.4,
      "end": 705.96,
      "text": "Because what I understand。"
    },
    {
      "start": 705.96,
      "end": 707.44,
      "text": "before watching this movie。"
    },
    {
      "start": 707.44,
      "end": 708.56,
      "text": "is I've been thinking about this。"
    },
    {
      "start": 708.56,
      "end": 710.08,
      "text": "recently a lot as well。"
    },
    {
      "start": 710.08,
      "end": 712.44,
      "text": "what I want so much。"
    },
    {
      "start": 712.44,
      "end": 713.76,
      "text": "desperately。"
    },
    {
      "start": 713.76,
      "end": 715.88,
      "text": "and work for it so desperately。"
    },
    {
      "start": 715.88,
      "end": 718.16,
      "text": "I actually have it already。"
    },
    {
      "start": 718.16,
      "end": 719.88,
      "text": "or I will have it eventually。"
    },
    {
      "start": 719.88,
      "end": 721.8,
      "text": "otherwise I wouldn't want it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 721.8,
      "end": 723.76,
      "text": "Right"
    },
    {
      "start": 723.76,
      "end": 726.48,
      "text": "if it's not writtenin my destiny。"
    },
    {
      "start": 726.48,
      "end": 727.44,
      "text": "or in my fate。"
    },
    {
      "start": 727.44,
      "end": 729.84,
      "text": "as it was said in the movie。"
    },
    {
      "start": 729.84,
      "end": 730.8,
      "text": "it wouldn't come to my mind。"
    },
    {
      "start": 730.8,
      "end": 732.6,
      "text": "because there are so many options。"
    },
    {
      "start": 732.6,
      "end": 733.6,
      "text": "if it comes to me。"
    },
    {
      "start": 733.6,
      "end": 734.8,
      "text": "it means I will have it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 734.8,
      "end": 736.32,
      "text": "so when I want something。"
    },
    {
      "start": 736.32,
      "end": 737.96,
      "text": "I shouldn't be so desperate。"
    },
    {
      "start": 737.96,
      "end": 738.92,
      "text": "of not having it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 738.92,
      "end": 740.52,
      "text": "because if it shows up。"
    },
    {
      "start": 740.52,
      "end": 742.56,
      "text": "it means it's already there。"
    },
    {
      "start": 742.56,
      "end": 743.6,
      "text": "Yeah that's right。"
    },
    {
      "start": 743.6,
      "end": 744.4,
      "text": "that's beautiful。"
    },
    {
      "start": 744.4,
      "end": 744.64,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 744.64,
      "end": 745.96,
      "text": "Thank you。"
    },
    {
      "start": 745.96,
      "end": 746.96,
      "text": "but what do you think。"
    },
    {
      "start": 746.96,
      "end": 747.8,
      "text": "No I agree。"
    },
    {
      "start": 747.8,
      "end": 748.48,
      "text": "I agree"
    },
    {
      "start": 748.48,
      "end": 750.32,
      "text": "and that kind of desire。"
    },
    {
      "start": 750.32,
      "end": 752.24,
      "text": "is a form of suffering。"
    },
    {
      "start": 752.24,
      "end": 753.8,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "start": 753.8,
      "end": 755.12,
      "text": "Yeah and so it's always good。"
    },
    {
      "start": 755.12,
      "end": 756.64,
      "text": "to ask yourself。"
    },
    {
      "start": 756.68,
      "end": 758.16,
      "text": "those kind of questions。"
    },
    {
      "start": 758.16,
      "end": 759.64,
      "text": "at whatever age you're at。"
    },
    {
      "start": 759.64,
      "end": 761.64,
      "text": "and think about the answers。"
    },
    {
      "start": 761.64,
      "end": 763.04,
      "text": "that are coming to you。"
    },
    {
      "start": 763.04,
      "end": 765.6,
      "text": "and yeah。"
    },
    {
      "start": 765.6,
      "end": 766.64,
      "text": "and at my age。"
    },
    {
      "start": 766.64,
      "end": 769.24,
      "text": "it's a lot in my life。"
    },
    {
      "start": 769.24,
      "end": 770.76,
      "text": "is settled。"
    },
    {
      "start": 770.76,
      "end": 772.0,
      "text": "it's funny that you say you're 30。"
    },
    {
      "start": 772.0,
      "end": 773.92,
      "text": "I remember when I turned 40。"
    },
    {
      "start": 773.92,
      "end": 774.92,
      "text": "this is so much nicer。"
    },
    {
      "start": 774.92,
      "end": 776.08,
      "text": "than turning 30。"
    },
    {
      "start": 776.08,
      "end": 776.76,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 776.76,
      "end": 777.84,
      "text": "because I thought。"
    },
    {
      "start": 777.84,
      "end": 779.28,
      "text": "there are so many questions。"
    },
    {
      "start": 779.28,
      "end": 780.6,
      "text": "that have been answered。"
    },
    {
      "start": 780.6,
      "end": 782.08,
      "text": "you know I met my wife。"
    },
    {
      "start": 782.08,
      "end": 783.24,
      "text": "and I had my children。"
    },
    {
      "start": 783.24,
      "end": 783.92,
      "text": "and I had you know。"
    },
    {
      "start": 783.92,
      "end": 784.48,
      "text": "and I'm like。"
    },
    {
      "start": 784.48,
      "end": 785.28,
      "text": "there's so much more。"
    },
    {
      "start": 785.28,
      "end": 786.6,
      "text": "that feels。"
    },
    {
      "start": 786.6,
      "end": 787.88,
      "text": "like it's calmed down。"
    },
    {
      "start": 787.88,
      "end": 788.64,
      "text": "in my life。"
    },
    {
      "start": 788.64,
      "end": 790.68,
      "text": "and that's a wonderful feeling。"
    },
    {
      "start": 790.68,
      "end": 792.0,
      "text": "that tranquility。"
    },
    {
      "start": 792.0,
      "end": 792.8,
      "text": "you enjoy it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 792.8,
      "end": 793.68,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 793.68,
      "end": 795.28,
      "text": "Yeah I think I will。"
    },
    {
      "start": 795.28,
      "end": 795.96,
      "text": "take your word。"
    },
    {
      "start": 795.96,
      "end": 797.96,
      "text": "like I will enjoy the sufferer。"
    },
    {
      "start": 797.96,
      "end": 799.8,
      "text": "also when the tranquility。"
    },
    {
      "start": 799.8,
      "end": 801.04,
      "text": "arrives I will enjoy it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 801.04,
      "end": 801.92,
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "start": 801.92,
      "end": 803.04,
      "text": "you will have earned it。"
    },
    {
      "start": 803.04,
      "end": 804.4,
      "text": "Thank you so much。"
    },
    {
      "start": 804.4,
      "end": 805.48,
      "text": "Really nice to meet you。"
    }
  ]
}